'''Lasalimu''' is an [[Austronesian language]] spoken on [[Buton Island]] off the southeast coast of [[Sulawesi]] in Indonesia. It belongs to the [[Muna–Buton languages|Muna–Buton]] branch of the [[Celebic languages|Celebic]] subgroup.

